  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Fellowships and Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will deliver a portfolio of existing commitments, particularly the Quad Infrastructure Fellowships Program, and enable targeted technical and policy engagement in the Indo-Pacific.  
 
Specifically the program will deliver:  
- Quad infrastructure fellowships: deliver 260 mid-career professional placements and 160 senior government executive fellowships to candidates from Southeast Asia, South Asia and Pacific island countries. 
- Alumni engagement: maintaining engagement with Quad infrastructure fellows and connecting them with alumni events held by other Quad partners. 
- Stakeholder engagement: primarily focussed on building and engaging with a domestic network to deliver infrastructure fellowships, the program will take a systematic approach to stakeholder engagement and management.
- Monitoring and evaluation: the program will develop a performance assessment framework and provide MEL services across the portfolio of activities included within the program</narrative>
  </description>
